  "variation-town-grocery-46d5dc39-plain-1-4views-v1": "true quarter turns, lettering reads true in NE and NW, light from the upper right, clean alpha; the rear door shows in SE only",
  "variation-town-hardware-bf36737f-plain-1-4views-v1": "true quarter turns, lettering reads true in NE and NW, light from the upper right, clean alpha",
